  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/wolfram2002-ch04-19> delphi:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/wolfram2002-ch04-19--grok--data-existence> .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/wolfram2002-ch04-19--grok--data-adequacy> a delphi:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Data adequacy of wolfram2002-ch04-19 by Grok 4.7: 0.95" ;
